# IMO 2016 P1
# Incenter I; D,E,F feet on BC,AC,AB. R on (I,D) with DR perp EF.
# P = (I,D) ∩ line AR. O1 circumcenter(ECP); O2 circumcenter(FBP).
# Q = (O1,P) ∩ (O2,P). T = DI ∩ PQ. Prove AI perp AT.

triangle A B C
incenter I A B C
foot D I B C
foot E I A C
foot F I A B
on_circle R I D
perp D R E F
inter_cl P I D A R
circumcenter O1 E C P
circumcenter O2 F B P
inter_cc Q O1 P O2 P
inter_ll T D I P Q
prove_perp A I A T
